WEBVTT

00:02:29.596 --> 00:02:33.396
and that we actually
have to stop trying to fix women

00:02:33.396 --> 00:02:35.676
and fix the structure.

00:02:36.116 --> 00:02:41.836
And the structures that allow women
to work and be a mother

00:02:41.876 --> 00:02:44.036
have always been broken.

00:02:44.076 --> 00:02:47.476
We've been the only industrialized nation
that doesn't offer paid leave.

00:02:47.476 --> 00:02:51.556
We've built workplaces
around a nine-to-five schedule

00:02:51.556 --> 00:02:53.396
when schools were open eight to three.

00:02:53.436 --> 00:02:58.316
We've always been having to balance
it all, i.e. having to do it all.

00:02:58.796 --> 00:03:01.476
And so we were never
going to get to equality